      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong start. The tone is definitely there and it feels premium.\n\nOne thing though—I just ran it through the client's tool and the score came back way lower than they were expecting. They're really obsessed with seeing those numbers go up to ensure they rank on the first page. \n\nCould you do another version? Try to increase the density of those keywords (organic, vegan, moisturizer, glow, radiance, botanical, nature, skin, luxury, hydration) to get a better score, but please—I'm serious—don't let it turn into a list of words. It still has to flow perfectly and sound like a high-end brand. Just try to weave them in more frequently so the score is higher.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
